    "sections": {
        "description": "Study For Next emphasizes simplicity, speed, and adaptability. Out of the box, it provides a clean editorial layout inspired by Twenty Twenty-Five alongside an accessible sticky navigation bar, three-level mega menu, and mobile off-canvas drawer. Built with native WooCommerce support, multipurpose block patterns, page templates, 10 header-to-footer color schemes, Smart Schema.org microdata, and a configurable Section Builder widget, it is ideal for blogs, online stores, business websites, news portals, and educational organizations."
